    "Reborn: Paradrop level upgraded; remaining cooldown preserved."
End

RebornDebug:ParadropClockTicking
    "Reborn: Paradrop clock ticking; object timers synchronized."
End

// Reborn: separate physical-tower and sidebar creation diagnostics from timer transfer messages.
