    "Reborn: Control Tower cooldown callback active."
End

RebornDebug:ParadropSidebarCreated
    "Reborn: Paradrop sidebar provider created."
End

// Reborn: runtime cast and native clock storage diagnostics.
RebornDebug:ParadropCastRecorded
    "Reborn: Paradrop cast recorded in native clock."
End

RebornDebug:ParadropClockStoreFailed
    "Reborn: Paradrop cast callback received, but native clock storage failed."
End

// Reborn: real spellbook and logic-clock diagnostics for the event-only timer bridge.
