    "Reborn: Paradrop logic clock active."
End

RebornDebug:ParadropSpellbookActive
    "Reborn: Paradrop real spellbook active."
End

RebornDebug:ParadropClockMissing
    "Reborn: Paradrop clock is not registered; native cooldown preserved."
End

// Reborn: distinguish delayed lifecycle synchronization from the one-second logic clock.
RebornDebug:ParadropDeferredSync
 "Reborn: Paradrop post-upgrade timers synchronized."
END

// Reborn: distinguish failure to request native clock creation from a missing child callback.
RebornDebug:ParadropClockRequestFailed
 "Reborn: Paradrop clock creation request failed."
END

// Reborn: report visibility-tech grant failure without disabling the independent saved cooldown.
RebornDebug:ParadropVisibilityGrantFailed
"Reborn: Paradrop sidebar visibility tech could not be granted."
END

// Reborn: a failed native OBJECT request must not alter the independent shared cooldown.
RebornDebug:ParadropSidebarRequestFailed
"Reborn: Paradrop sidebar provider request failed."
END


APT:CAMPAIGNMODESELECTIONHELPTEXT
	"Prepare for battle! Click the Solo button for single-player mode, or click the Co-op button to host a co-op match that another player can join.\n\nTo join a co-op match, click the ComLink star in the upper-right-hand corner and log into GameSpy. Once the host invites you to a match, you'll see the invite on the Invites tab in the ComLink. Select the invite and join the host's match."
End

APT:SOVIETRA3SHORTNAME
	"SOVIETS - RA3"
End

APT:ALLIESRA3SHORTNAME
	"ALLIES - RA3"
End

APT:JAPANRA3SHORTNAME
	"JAPAN - RA3"
End

// Reborn: RA3 campaign strings and imported mission dialogue subtitles.

MISSIONNAME:SOVIETS_10
	"SOVIET CAMPAIGN EPILOGUE"
End

MISSIONNAME:ALLIES_10
	"ALLIES CAMPAIGN EPILOGUE"
End

MISSIONNAME:SOVIETS_5_SHORT
	"MYKONOS"
End

MISSIONNAME:SOVIETS_5
	"MYKONOS - THE SCIENCE OF WAR"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*The Soviet Union is on Britain's doorstep. You must do everything possible to repel the incoming attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*Expect waves of Soviet forces to approach by air drop."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Unfortunately we do not have heavy armor reinforcements at this time."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*You must make due with the coastal defenses already at Brighton Beach. Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*The Soviet forces are continuing their frontal assault, even though your defenses have held. You must keep fighting."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*We detect a large fleet of their Kirov airships in the vicinity. Be prepared, and good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*The Soviets are inbound. You must assemble an infantry division in order to stop them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*Remember that you have access to an Armor Facility and therefore can build Multigunner IFVs."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*You also have access to the Multigunner Turret base defenses, which should keep the enemy at bay."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*The IFV is armed with a rocket launcher, though you can modify its weapon by ordering any infantry unit inside."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*We need you to get those beach defenses back online. The Soviet forces are almost here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*The Soviets are approaching with their Mobile Construction Vehicles. While unarmed, they are heavily armored."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*Soviet combat wave defeated. Additional Soviet units still incoming."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*A final Soviet assault wave has been detected on radar."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*Try to build up as many defenses and garrison as many structures as you can."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*More MCV's inbound. Take them down before they reach the beach."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*MCV's are down. Dispose of any additional Soviet forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*The Soviet Dreadnought's ballistic rockets can destroy your forces- beware of their danger."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*There is a Hospital to the south. One of your Engineers can capture it to transfer its healing benefits to your infantry forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel20SubTitle
	"*This Hospital will now automatically heal your infantry units."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel21SubTitle
	"*Commander, the Soviets have destroyed your base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel22SubTitle
	"*Commander, the Soviets have destroyed your Co-Commander's base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel23SubTitle
	"*Brighton Beach is under siege by Soviet forces. The city must be liberated so we can bolster our defense against additional waves."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel24SubTitle
	"*We are mustering defenses. Please make do with these Peacekeepers and Attack Dogs for now."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel25SubTitle
	"*Peacekeepers are especially effective against enemy infantry in very close quarters. Their riot shields let them close the distance."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel26SubTitle
	"*Our Attack Dogs recently acquired amplification modules, allowing their barks to deafen and stun enemy infantry."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel27SubTitle
	"*This base will be your staging area against the incoming attack waves."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel28SubTitle
	"*Your co-commander has been issued a Mobile Construction Vehicle to provide additional support."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel29SubTitle
	"*The Soviet armada appears to be spread out. Their first wave is imminent."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel30SubTitle
	"*A Soviet naval force has been detected off the coast. The armada will be here shortly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel31SubTitle
	"*Javelin Soldiers are now authorized in the defense of this area. Train them from the Boot Camp."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel32SubTitle
	"*Vehicle production authority granted. You now have access to the Multigunner Infantry Fighting Vehicle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel33SubTitle
	"*Multigunner IFVs are available from the Armor Facility."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel34SubTitle
	"*Brighton's long-dormant coastal defenses can be brought to bear against the enemy."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel35SubTitle
	"*To bring the guns online, train Engineers from your Boot Camp and send them inside the coastal guns."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel36SubTitle
	"You are authorized to construct an Armor Facility and Multigunner Turret defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel39SubTitle
	"The civilian population has been evacuated. Your infantry may garrison the deserted structures for protection."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedintel40SubTitle
	"You have been assigned a Co-Commander for this mission. He will aid in the defense of Great Britain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedsoldier01SubTitle
	"Allied bombers inbound, Commander. Ready to pound the ground."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_alliedsoldier02SubTitle
	"Don't worry, Commander, we've got your back."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_cogiles01SubTitle
	"*Looks like they're advancing towards your base. I'll send my forces south to assist you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_cogiles02SubTitle
	"*Beach defenses are online. These should shake things up a little bit."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma01_cogiles03SubTitle
	"*Hah, looks like we've done it! Those Soviets got too greedy for their own good this time."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*The Soviets are entrenched in Cannes and have set up a naval blockade in this region. We cannot attack head-on."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*However, we have detected vulnerabilities in the Soviet perimeter and are sending an infiltration team to break through their ranks. Here is what we need you to do:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Infiltrate the Soviet island-harbors."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*Find a way to eliminate the naval blockade."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*We also have a wing of Allied aircraft trapped here. Try to recover it if possible."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*Agent Tanya will be joining you for this mission. Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*The Soviet navy is in disarray. This is the opportunity to strike."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*Focus your efforts on the Soviet military installation on land."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*If you can take it out, we will have regained our defensive foothold in France."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*Commander, your Spies can disguise themselves as enemy troops."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*Select the Spy and target an enemy unit for attack. The Spy will assume that unit's form."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*Once disguised, your Spies can walk into enemy territory undetected."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*Commander, those Russian Bears operate mainly by smell- they can sniff out disguised Spies."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*If the Spies are detected, they'll lose their disguise."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*Great job, Commander. We're teleporting in reinforcements to your location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*Great job, Commander. We're sending reinforcements to your location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*You have access to the same Technology as your co-commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*Commander, your Spies can also bring enemies to our side with the bribe ability."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*The Soviets have destroyed your base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel20SubTitle
	"*The Soviets have destroyed your Co-Commander's base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel21SubTitle
	"*Without Tanya or a Barracks you'll be unable to continue. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel22SubTitle
	"*Commander, without Spies or a Barracks you'll be unable to continue. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel23SubTitle
	"*Commander, you destroyed your objective instead of infiltrating it. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel24SubTitle
	"*Commander, you destroyed your objective instead of garrisoning it. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel25SubTitle
	"*Commander, you destroyed your objective instead of liberating it. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel26SubTitle
	"*Leaders from several Allied nations are pinned in the Convention Center. Clear the Soviet forces from the area so they can evacuate."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel27SubTitle
	"*Our Vindicator bombers cannot take off as long as those Soviet defenses are intact - take the defenses offline to recover our aircraft."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel28SubTitle
	"*Our Spies may use their Bribe ability to convert those Soviet forces to work for us."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel29SubTitle
	"*The Allied leaders are under siege. You must liberate the conference center."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel30SubTitle
	"*Our Spies must be sent into each of those Port structures. Train additional Spies if need be."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel31SubTitle
	"*Those Soviet Dreadnoughts are bombarding our position. Find a way to sink them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel32SubTitle
	"*The main Soviet base in Cannes is now vulnerable to direct attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel33SubTitle
	"*Your co-commander has been defeated. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_alliedintel34SubTitle
	"*Do not attack the Port buildings – to do so endangers the mission objectives."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_cowarren01SubTitle
	"*Observation Post captured. Now we can see what these Soviets are up to."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_cowarren02SubTitle
	"*I'll be working towards getting the Allied leadership freed, Commander. Your assistance would be welcome."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_cowarren03SubTitle
	"*Those Dreadnoughts are making it real hard to advance on the Soviet's base. Are you going to take those out, Commander?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_tanya03SubTitle
	"Gah, Tesla Coils! Commander, I need you to send our Spies in and take down their power. That'll give me enough time to run in and blow up those defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma02_tanya06SubTitle
	"Attention Soviet fleet: Return to harbor immediately. There is evidence of onboard insurgents. All vehicles subject to search."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*The Soviet headquarters is located here in Heidelberg. Your mission is to setup base and destroy the headquarters."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*Here is what we need you to do:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Escort your Mobile Construction Vehicles upriver. Intel suggests the Soviets may not be expecting an amphibious assault."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*Stage a direct assault against the Soviet headquarters near Heidelberg castle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*Coordinate attacks upon the Soviets- they have much production capability. Good luck with your mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*The Soviet headquarters is protected by a device called the Iron Curtain. Be very careful when engaging forces augmented by this device."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*Your primary objective is to take out the Soviet headquarters. Do whatever it takes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*Get those MCV's safely up the ramps, Commander. I'll brief you on the rest of the mission once you're done."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*Your Hydrofoils can toggle between two weapons, a standard attack and Weapon Jammer.  Target those Tesla Coils with the Jammer and your Co-Commander's dolphins should be able to approach them unharmed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*That Iron Curtain is able to temporarily make a Soviet force invincible."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*Commander, our Vindicators are primed for hit and run attacks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*Your Hydrofoils have been destroyed.  Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*Your Co-Commander's dolphins have been destroyed. Mission Aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*Your base has been destroyed, Commander. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*The Soviets have destroyed your Co-Commander's base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*The Soviets appear to have built their base with the majority of their power and resources in vulnerable positions."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*Striking at those targets should significantly reduce their effectiveness in defending against our attacks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*The enemy has sold off those outer base defenses, in order to bring his inner base defenses back online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*There are two more Super-Reactors north-east of the War Factories. Taking those down should cut power to the Soviet base again."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_coliss01SubTitle
	"*Vindicator team inbound on Soviet Iron Curtain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_coliss02SubTitle
	"*I've taken down their north base. I'm heading down to help you finish up the other one."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_coliss03SubTitle
	"*Nice work. How about giving me a helping hand with this other part of their base?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_coliss04SubTitle
	"*All right, this is it. Let's move on their HQ and get this over with."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_tanya01SubTitle
	"Commander, the Soviets have set up shop down here and have me completely surrounded."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma03_tanya02SubTitle
	"There's too much heat for me to leave safely. I'm gonna need you to come down here and get me."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*The Empire of the Rising Sun has overtaken Gibraltar and is using it to stage attacks against both Allied and Soviet positions. Here is your mission:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*Extract our field agent making his escape from the area. He has vital information."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Locate and recover our naval forces that are on lockdown in this area."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*Find and eliminate the Imperial forces stationed around the Gibraltar airport."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*As you know, this is a joint Allied-Soviet initiative. The Soviet Union which has agreed to collaborate with Allied forces against the Empire."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*Agent Tanya as well as the Soviet Union's own Natasha will be on the ground to ensure our joint task force is working together as expected. Good luck in the field."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*Commanders, both the Prospector and Sputnik can be used to expand your base onto land."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*An approaching Imperial Fleet has been detected on radar."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*Commander, a forward recon element has called for backup in Gibraltar."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*We are sending you and our new Soviet ally to assist them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*We're pulling out the big guns for this too, both of you  will be deployed with your Spek-Ops units"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*The powers that be are pulling out the big guns for this one - Allied forces will receive Tanya and our Soviet friends, Natasha."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*Our spy has been debriefed. The Assault Destroyers are located in the port."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*They are heavily guarded- becareful."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*Take out those Turrets and they'll be good to go."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*You'll need to take out the turrets, then send in some engineers to get the destroyers running again."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*Warning: A King Oni battlewalker has been detected on the rock of Gibraltar."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*It may identify our assault forces unless it is eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*Cryo-technology access upgraded. You are authorized to construct Cryocopters, which can freeze or shrink enemy forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel20SubTitle
	"*Target the landed aircraft to clear the runways."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel21SubTitle
	"*Assault Destroyers online. You are authorized to construct additional Destroyers at your Seaport."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_alliedintel22SubTitle
	"*Alert: Your co-commander requires your assitance."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_natasha02SubTitle
	"Oh Tanya, when will you learn? From Mother Russia's bosom spring soldiers who are superior in every way. And I am the greatest of these."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_natasha04SubTitle
	"This is not cold! I once swam Siberia's Lena River. Now that is cold!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_tanya02SubTitle
	"Why you little... Commander, permission to speak freely? I hate that chick!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma04_tanya06SubTitle
	"Whoa baby! That's chilly!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*We have organized a strike against the Empire's armada situated in the North Sea. We do not yet have accurate details about the composition of this fleet."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*This will be another joint operation with Soviet forces. Your first order of business will be the following:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Assist in the salvage operation of a downed Imperial vessel."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*Our salvage ship will need to be defended whilst the information on the Empire's armada is recovered."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*Once the data is recovered, standby for further orders in the field. Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*This junker contains necessary data on the Floating Island Fortress. Protect our recovery vessel until we can extra all the data from the wreck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*The salvage boat has been destroyed. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*Intelligence recovered…commence analysis."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*Those two Radar Boats allow the Fortress to attack long range targets. They must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*With the Radar Boats destroyed, our MCVs can get close enough to deploy."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*We're taking heavy losses. Allied Command is uploading emergency plans for the Aircraft Carrier."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*Allied Command has given access to construct the Century Bomber. With it, we can drop bombs…or infantry."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*Intelligence has dispatched a new regiment of Spies. Try to take better care of these."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*There are all the Engineers our Soviet friends could spare. Use them wisely."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*Use your Engineers to capture the Fortress Reactors.  They'll overload the cores, making them unstable."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*We'll need to establish a beachhead before we can produce any ground units."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*With both Reactors simultaneously destabilized, the Fortress' power system will reach critical mass."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*One of the Reactors has been destroyed. There's no way for us to take the Fortress down now. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*One Reactor has been captured and destabilized. Both reactors must be captured."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel20SubTitle
	"*The unstable Reactor has corrected itself. You'll need to send in another Engineer."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel21SubTitle
	"*The Radar Boat is vulnerable. Send Natasha to destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel22SubTitle
	"*Commander, Spies can take down the power to the guns, allowing Natasha to get close enough to destroy them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel23SubTitle
	"*Enemy Ships inbound."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel24SubTitle
	"*The way to the radar ship is clear. Use Tanya to destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel25SubTitle
	"*Enemy Aircraft are targeting the recovery ship- it must survive."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel26SubTitle
	"*Keep the Japanese away from the recovery ship."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel27SubTitle
	"*Clear a path for the Soviet Engineers so they can hack the powerplants"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel28SubTitle
	"*Let the Engineer know when it is safe to enter a power plant."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel29SubTitle
	"*The Soviet Engineers can hack these powerplants to take down the defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel30SubTitle
	"*The Imperial Radar Ship in the vicinity allow the Floating Fortress to attack long range targets. Destroy every Radar Ship you find."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_alliedintel31SubTitle
	"*This sunken battleship contains details on the Imperial Floating Fortress nearby. Protect our recovery vessel while we extract the data."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_natasha01SubTitle
	"I have Radar Boat in sight. Is cowering behind gun emplacement ... like child."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_natasha02SubTitle
	"Wait here while I get to work."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_natasha03SubTitle
	"I need that Generator deactivated before I can get in range."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_natasha04SubTitle
	"First Power Plant eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_natasha05SubTitle
	"Another Power Plant destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_natasha06SubTitle
	"All Generators destroyed. Targeting Radar Boat."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_tanay01SubTitle
	"The second Radar Ship is under heavy guard. We need to be careful."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_tanay04SubTitle
	"It's working! The first guns are active."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_tanay05SubTitle
	"Let's go grab another Generator."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma05_tanay08SubTitle
	"The second Radar Ship has gone belly up. Send in the MCV's!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*The President Ackerman has targeted with Soviet Union with some sort of weapon located within a firing base at the foot of Mt. Rushmore."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*Allied command requires you to stop him. Your objective is this:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Destroy the Radio Tower before President Ackerman can trasmit the launch codes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*Expect to face forces loyal to the American President on this mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*We do not know what else President Ackerman has in store in this region and will update you as we learn more. Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*We are not fully aware of Mt. Rushmore's firing capability. However, please be advised of the following:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*Each of the weaponized heads appears to be linked to a control center. You may be able to disable the heads at those control centers."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*Your primary objective is to stop the President's plan by destroying the Rushmore firing base before he gets there."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*Afterwards, you will be authorized to engage the President's vehicle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*Commander, the radio tower is just ahead. You need to take it out before Ackerman can transmit the launch signal."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*The Power Plant supplying the base defenses is located to the northwest. Take it out to bring those guns offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*With the Radio Tower has been destroyed, Ackerman cannot transmit the launch code."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*The Intercontinental Laser inside of Mount Rushmore is still capable of firing, but Ackerman is going to need to get inside the Firebase to trigger it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*You have however long it takes the President to reach the Firebase to prevent the attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*Your Engineers could reactivate this abandoned base by capturing it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*Massive power surges have been detected beneath Mount Rushmore."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*Ackerman has activated a high-powered laser defense at Mt. Rushmore- within each president's head. You'll need to capture the Control Center to deactivate it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*Another presidential head capable of firing lasers has come online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*Rushmore Control Center captured. One of the lasers is powering down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel20SubTitle
	"*You now have access to construct Mirage Tanks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel21SubTitle
	"*You have been authorized to construct Spectrum Towers. They are very effective anti-vehicle defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel22SubTitle
	"*The President is enroute to the firing base. It must be destroyed before he arrives."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel23SubTitle
	"*The President is getting close to the Firebase."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel24SubTitle
	"*Ackerman's at the Firebase. Launch of Intercontinental Laser imminent…Mission Failed"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel25SubTitle
	"*The Firebase has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel26SubTitle
	"*Ackerman has boarded a helicopter. It must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel27SubTitle
	"*President Ackerman has escaped….Mission Failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel28SubTitle
	"*The President has moved from his Limo to an escape helicopter. Take it down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel29SubTitle
	"*The base defenses guarding the Com Tower are connected to the Power Plant to the north west."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel30SubTitle
	"*Those are enemy Attack Dogs. Your Engineers and Spies should avoid them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel31SubTitle
	"*Capturing a Head Control Center with an Engineer will take one of the Rushmore head lasers offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel32SubTitle
	"*Power to the Base Defenses has been cut."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel33SubTitle
	"*George Washington's weapon systems are now online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel34SubTitle
	"*Thomas Jefferson's weapon systems are now online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel35SubTitle
	"*Abraham Lincoln's weapon systems are now online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel36SubTitle
	"*Roosevelt's weapon systems are now online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel37SubTitle
	"*The Head Control Centers are not accessible by land. You will need to air-drop Engineers in order to reach them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_alliedintel38SubTitle
	"*Our Mirage Tank assault forces have been stationed here all along. They are now under your control."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr01SubTitle
	"*Just tell me where you need these Spies and Engineers."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr02SubTitle
	"*My Spies can temporarily disable that Power Plant."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr03SubTitle
	"*Sit tight, I've got anti-vehicle troops headed your way."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr04SubTitle
	"*I'm going to set up at that abandoned base over there."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr05SubTitle
	"*The President is getting close. We need to stop him."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr06SubTitle
	"*OK... how are we supposed to fight a mountain?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr07SubTitle
	"*I'll try to take back the control center."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr08SubTitle
	"*I just took one of those giant heads offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr09SubTitle
	"*I'll try to take that Barracks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr10SubTitle
	"*These Spectrum Towers are tearing me apart..."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma06_cowarr11SubTitle
	"*Man, to think I even voted for this nutjob..."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*The time has come for our joint attack against the Imperial military infrastructure in Tokyo Harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*Soviet forces were waylaid en route to this location so you must engage the Empire and await Soviet reinforcements."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Your objectives here are as follows:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*Eliminate the Battleship blockade preventing Soviet forces into the harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*Use our Chronosphere to transfer forces across the field to surround the Imperial defenders."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*Destroy the Empire's military capability in this region."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*Succeed, and the Empire will fall--it will no longer be a threat. Be careful in this operation, and good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*The situation has turned for the worse. We have word that Soviet reinforcements have turned around."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*You will need to find a way to complete this mission with the resources you already have."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*Commander, you must hurry and destroy the Imperial blockade."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*The Imperial Military Head Quarters has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*The Imperial Harbor is no more."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*The Imperial Robotics Lab has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*The Imperial Super Weapon has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*Some of your forces withstood the Imperial psionic decimator. We must counterattack immediately using our own Chronosphere."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*Use the Chronosphere to split your forces by teleporting them across the battlefield."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*A pincer attack may take the Empire of the Rising Sun by surprise."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*The Grand Dojos of the Empire of the Rising Sun have been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_alliedintel20SubTitle
	"*Our Athena Cannon long-range bombardment reinforcements have arrived, and you are now authorized to produce more as needed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_coliss01SubTitle
	"*Just give the signal and I'll setup at the secondary location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_coliss02SubTitle
	"*Well done, that's one less thing to worry about."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_coliss03SubTitle
	"*Nice job, you beat me to that one."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_coliss04SubTitle
	"*So the Soviets aren't coming? What do you think? Can handle this one on our own...?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma07_coliss05SubTitle
	"*This must be where all those Imperial robots come from. I bet if we wipe this place out, they won't have a leg left to stand on."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*We have reasonable suspicions of Soviet activity here in Havana. Allied command is concerned, due to this region's proximity to several Allied nations."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*Your mission here is as follows:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Your expeditionary force must discover the nature and strength of the Soviet forces here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*Be prepared to engage Soviet forces if necessary."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*The Soviet Union is staging bombing runs from Havana using modified sporting arenas."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*These arenas all must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*Ensure none of the Soviet Kirov Airships exits this airspace."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*Our information network should have seen this sooner. Please forgive us, and good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*We've disguised this Mirage Tank as a Soviet Apocalypse Tank,  in order to sneak troops past the Soviets.  Keep close to the Tank while its mirage field is active and you'll be invisible."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*Use your spies to bribe enemy soldiers, and they will join your side."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*Kill or bribe the soldiers to clear the way for the mirage tank."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*Investigate Havana for Soviet activity"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*Commander, we need to know the location of the Soviet Base"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*The Soviet base has been located. It must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*You must not let any Kirov's get away."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*Take out the Kirov Launch Facilities to prevent the Kirovs from launching."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*Commander, you need to keep your troops under the mirage field."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*A Kirov is almost out of Havana- you must not let it get away."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*Another Kirov is about to escape."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel20SubTitle
	"*That Kirov is about to get way."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel21SubTitle
	"*The Mirage Tank has been destroyed. Mission Failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel22SubTitle
	"*All of your troops have been killed. Mission Failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel23SubTitle
	"*A Kirov escaped our grasp. Aborting mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel24SubTitle
	"*There is another Kirov in the sky."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel25SubTitle
	"*They've launched another Kirov."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_alliedintel26SubTitle
	"*Order your forces to get closer to the Mirage Tank, to signal to your Co-Commander that you are ready to keep moving forward."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles01SubTitle
	"*The Soviets must have some sort of salvage operation here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles02SubTitle
	"*Don't get crushed by those tanks!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles03SubTitle
	"*Heads-up, MiG fighters overhead."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles04SubTitle
	"*Don't worry, I don't think they spotted us."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles05SubTitle
	"*Never thought I'd get saluted by the likes of them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles06SubTitle
	"*Look! Real apocalypse tanks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles07SubTitle
	"*Back up! Back up!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles08SubTitle
	"*Let's take them on! Disengaging gap generator and switching to combat mode."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles09SubTitle
	"*Not if we start taking out these sports arenas!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles10SubTitle
	"*There's only one sports arena left."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles11SubTitle
	"*You see, commander? A proper military education and a steady temper always wins the day. I'll be sure to put in a jolly good word for you if you do the same. See you back at Command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles12SubTitle
	"*Reinforcements have arrived.  Let's build up and roll out."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles13SubTitle
	"*That Kirov! It's almost left Havana!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles14SubTitle
	"*I'll make sure to shoot down as many Kirovs going over the sea as I can."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles15SubTitle
	"*I'll expand to that area right away."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles16SubTitle
	"*Let me know if you want me to expand out."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles17SubTitle
	"*Oh I think they will alright!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles18SubTitle
	"*That vehicle there is my Mirage tank disguised as a Soviet Apocalypse tank. You'll be in command of the spies behind it. Now as long as you stay close to my Mirage tank, nobody can see you. And as long as this Soviet disguise holds up they won't attack me. Got it? Okay, let's get moving."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cogiles19SubTitle
	"*Good grief! This is terrible! They're launching Kirov's out of the sports arenas. If we don't take them down ourselves, they'll escape and wipe out one of our cities!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr01SubTitle
	"*That MCV is kind of…cute?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr02SubTitle
	"*Well that was interesting!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr03SubTitle
	"*Let's kick these Soviets off the plateau."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr04SubTitle
	"*If we let the premier go to Space, there's no telling what he might do!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr05SubTitle
	"*Maybe we should just let them go to the moon…"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr06SubTitle
	"*We're running out of time."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr07SubTitle
	"*I'll meet up with your forces shortly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr08SubTitle
	"*I'll start taking out the eastern Iron Curtains, one by one."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr09SubTitle
	"*I'm going to take down the western Iron Curtains now."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr10SubTitle
	"*Let's focus our assault on the shuttle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma08_cowarr11SubTitle
	"*I'll fire the Proton Collider on that base at once."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel01SubTitle
	"*The decision is made to bring the Soviet leadership to justice. We are mobilizing our forces to appear on their doorstep in Leningrad."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel02SubTitle
	"*We are trying a risky tactic: shrinking our MCVs to get deep into Soviet territory to take them by surprise."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel03SubTitle
	"*Expect fierce resistance. Here are your objectives:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel04SubTitle
	"*Clear a drop zone for Allied forces incoming via our Chronosphere technology."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel05SubTitle
	"*Eliminate the Soviet defenses in this area."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel06SubTitle
	"*Ensure the Soviet Premier does not escape. Bring down his fortress."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel07SubTitle
	"*The Soviet Premier is attempting to escape."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel08SubTitle
	"*Your priority is to destroy the fortress launch facility before he succeeds."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel09SubTitle
	"*Good luck. This is it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel10SubTitle
	"*We're shrinking your MCV's so you can sneak past the Soviet Defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel11SubTitle
	"*Good luck, Commanders. Above all else, avoid being crushed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel12SubTitle
	"*The destroyed Soviet bases can be used as expansion locations."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel13SubTitle
	"*T-minus 25 minutes until the Shuttle Launch"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel14SubTitle
	"*T-minus 15 minutes until the Shuttle Launch"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel15SubTitle
	"*T-minus 10 minutes until Shuttle Launch."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel16SubTitle
	"*5 minutes until Shuttle Launch. The situation is reaching critical mass."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel17SubTitle
	"*The Soviet Shuttle has launched- Mission Failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel18SubTitle
	"*All of your forces have been destroyed. Aborting mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel19SubTitle
	"*They took out one of our MCV's. Aborting mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel20SubTitle
	"*If you need resources, expand to one of those destroyed bases."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel21SubTitle
	"*Your MCV has unpacked outside the chrono drop zone. Chrono coordinates lost. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel22SubTitle
	"*General Krukov’s military base has come online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel23SubTitle
	"*General Krukov has activated the vacuum imploder. Destroy it before he uses it on your base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel24SubTitle
	"*An Iron Curtain has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel25SubTitle
	"*All Iron Curtains offline. The shuttle launch facility is now vulnerable."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel26SubTitle
	"*The shuttle launch facility must be destroyed before the Premier escapes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel27SubTitle
	"*The launch facility is highly resistant to direct fire. Find a way to bring it down quickly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ma09_alliedintel28SubTitle
	"*Commander - you are cleared to construct the Proton Collider. The effects of this weapon would be catastrophic to any of the densely-packed Soviet bases here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me01_coshin01SubTitle
	"*I shall take the hospital."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me01_coshin02SubTitle
	"*The Emperor wants to make a symbolic strike on the statues in the square."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me01_coshin03SubTitle
	"*The military barracks in the area are supplying reinforcements. We should shut them down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me01_coshin04SubTitle
	"*That's one statue down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me01_coshin05SubTitle
	"*It appears there was quite a celebration going on here... Pitiable fools."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me01_coshin06SubTitle
	"*There are the boats. Let us send them to the bottom."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me01_coshin07SubTitle
	"*More enemy patrols!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj01SubTitle
	"*Don't you worry commander, those Tengus can take anything the enemy throws at them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj02SubTitle
	"*I've got my eyes trained on that shoreline commander. Your Nano-Cores have nothing to fear."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj03SubTitle
	"*Just give the word commander and I'll expand over to the West"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj04SubTitle
	"*Expanding to these ore mines will double my effective income. Should I claim them if you don't want them?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj05SubTitle
	"*Unless you say otherwise, I'll protect the Statue and you can protect the trains."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj06SubTitle
	"*Just give the order commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj07SubTitle
	"*That's it. Our plan is proceeding as expected."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj08SubTitle
	"*Hmm, well done."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj09SubTitle
	"*Soviet incompetents. It's a wonder they even fight back."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj10SubTitle
	"*Excellent. We're almost there."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me02_cokenj11SubTitle
	"*Just a few more trains, and General Tatsu's plan will assure the Empire will dominate over Eastern Europe."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me03_cokenj01SubTitle
	"*The Shogun Executioner lives! Now we shall make these fools suffer dearly. Go on, Commander, send it on its way!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me03_cokenj02SubTitle
	"*Hah! Look at them scatter!!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me03_cokenj03SubTitle
	"*The Executioner is taking damage! Move it near one of their Tesla weapons to make it regenerate!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me04_conaom01SubTitle
	"*The begin their pitiful attack! They will shatter against our defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me04_conaom02SubTitle
	"*Where are our Battleships? They should have been here by now!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me04_conaom03SubTitle
	"*Ah, the Battleships are here! Commander, let us show these mongrels  the true power of the Imperial navy."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me05_conaom01SubTitle
	"*What... They striking at the very heart of the fortress! We need to stop them!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me05_conaom02SubTitle
	"*These dogs would attack us on our very soil. They will come no further."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me06_conaom01SubTitle
	"*The coast is almost as crowded as Tokyo."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me06_conaom02SubTitle
	"*I'm going to clear some space for my MCV to unpack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me06_conaom03SubTitle
	"*I have established a foothold. Is there anything you else you need?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me06_conaom04SubTitle
	"*This \"fun zone\" at the beach might be fun to destroy!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me06_conaom05SubTitle
	"*Look, it's one of those corporate, sell-out companies! We should destroy it while we are here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me06_conaom06SubTitle
	"*The authorities inside the donut shops are attacking!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me06_conaom07SubTitle
	"*It appears our message is getting out to the civilians!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me07_coshin01SubTitle
	"*So much destruction from such an unsuspecting little girl!  Hahahaa!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me07_coshin02SubTitle
	"*Once again they have no recourse!  Charge through their defenses!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me07_coshin03SubTitle
	"*I could not have planned this any better!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me07_coshin04SubTitle
	"*From the shadows, we will strike at them until they collapse."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me07_coshin05SubTitle
	"*The battle is only getting started!  If only they knew what surprises were yet in store for them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me07_coshin06SubTitle
	"*If you need any support, Commander.  Simply say the word."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me08_cokenj01SubTitle
	"*Our versatility will be paramount in this battle, Commander.  Be on your toes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me08_cokenj02SubTitle
	"*Let the Shogun Executioner deal with these mongrels.  We can clean up after."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me08_cokenj03SubTitle
	"*It seems there are spoils of war left in the wake of destruction.  Commander?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me08_cokenj04SubTitle
	"*Those treacherous worms!  They're shelling us from their hiding spots!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me08_cokenj05SubTitle
	"*Are you in trouble again, Commander?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin01SubTitle
	"*I shall target the Air Base"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin02SubTitle
	"*I shall target Bingham himself!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin03SubTitle
	"*The FutureTech Headquarters shall fall!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin04SubTitle
	"*Relocating Construction Yard to land."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin05SubTitle
	"*At last, our airforce is back online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin06SubTitle
	"*Ah yes, dry land. Deploying construction yard."
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin07SubTitle
	"*The Proton Colliders cannot be left operational. Leave it to me!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin08SubTitle
	"*None shall stand before the King Oni!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:me09_coshin09SubTitle
	"*So this is it, the final stand! May fate be on our side."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*The Emperor's chosen target is the quaint Russian village of Vorkuta, which is in the midst of year-end festivities. Here are your orders:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*Take the Soviets' coastal defenses offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*Shatter the historic monuments in the market square."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*Sink the Soviet naval forces at the harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*The coast is too fortified for us  to land a full invasion force."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*You will need to infiltrate with a small force and take out the coastal guns."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*Disable the power plants to take the coastal guns offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*Commander, the Emperor has graciously decided to grant you a Final Squadron power for each primary objective destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*Ah! A Final Squadron awaits your command!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*One gun has been destroyed!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*Another gun has been destroyed! Keep at it, Commander!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*All coastal guns destroyed. Reinforcements are inbound."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*Our Imperial Warriors can close ground on enemy infantry by using their charge ability."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*These Armored Assassins have great proficiency when it comes to eliminating vehicles."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*Rising Sun Engineers are making their way to the coast."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*The Engineers have arrived. Use them to capture buildings."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*One statue destroyed, three remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*Two monuments are left."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*Only one statue remains."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*The Rising Sun Navy and Naval Yards must be eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel22SubTitle
	"*The Yari Mini-Sub has a Kamikaze attack. Use it to take out the Soviet ships."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel23SubTitle
	"*Tesla Troopers detected near one of the monuments."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel24SubTitle
	"*Tesla Troopers detected near the bridge. Our Imperial shinobi should be able to strike them before they strike back."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel25SubTitle
	"*A Soviet Reactor is beyond the reach of your forces. However, it is not beyond the reach of the Final Squadron protocol you've been granted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel26SubTitle
	"*More of our warriors have arrived on shore. They await your command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel27SubTitle
	"*Several Imperial shinobi have appeared to aid you in your objectives. The Soviet Tesla Troopers will not be expecting them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel28SubTitle
	"*Use the Sudden Transport's Evacuate ability to release your warriors from it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel29SubTitle
	"*Our Mini-Subs cannot get close enough to the Soviet navy. Eliminate the Tesla Coils so they can attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel30SubTitle
	"*These Reactors are linked to the Tesla Coils defending the docks. Destroy them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel31SubTitle
	"*Our Engineers have arrived near the shoreline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel32SubTitle
	"*Do not hesitate to use the Final Squadron protocols granted you by our Emperor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel33SubTitle
	"*Either destroy the Tesla Coils or the Reactors that are powering them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel34SubTitle
	"*Tesla Coils offline. The Mini-Subs may now attack undettered."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi01_imperialintel35SubTitle
	"*The Soviet Navy and Naval Yards must be eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*The stage is set for our full-scale assault on the Soviet heartland."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*The Soviets have gathered on the outskirts of Stalingrad. These are your orders:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*The Soviets cherish an historic statue in this area. Destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*Secure the train station here and do not let it come to harm. We will use it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*The Shogunate has called for a symbol of his excellency the Emperor Yoshiro to be erected in place of the statue you destroyed, without delay."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*You are ordered to defend the construction site. Expect the Soviets to resist but do not allow it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*The train station must remain unharmed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*The Emperor demands that the symbol of Soviet Victory be reduced to rubble."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*The Emperor wishes this Soviet monument destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*The Soviets are mounting a major offensive in hope of reclaiming Stalingrad."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*Long range scanners have detected an incoming Soviet force."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*It appears that a Soviet recon force is headed for your location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*Soviets incoming in 5 minutes"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*Soviets incoming in 4 minutes"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*Soviets incoming in 3 minutes"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*Soviets incoming in 2 minutes"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*Soviets incoming in 1 minutes"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*More Soviets emerge from the North."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*More Soviets make their way from the West."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*More Soviets arrive from the South."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel22SubTitle
	"*More Soviets ride in from the East."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel23SubTitle
	"*The Emperor's Statue will be complete in 15 minutes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel24SubTitle
	"*The Emperor's Statue will be complete in 10 minutes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel25SubTitle
	"*The Emperor's Statue will be complete in 5 minutes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel26SubTitle
	"*The Emperor's Statue will be complete in 3 minutes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel27SubTitle
	"*The statue shall be finished in 5 Minutes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel28SubTitle
	"*The statue shall be finished in 3 Minutes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel29SubTitle
	"*The statue shall be finished in 1 Minutes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel30SubTitle
	"*A second train has set forth"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel31SubTitle
	"*The last of the trains is exiting the station. It must remain intact."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel32SubTitle
	"*The train is under attack- it must survive."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel33SubTitle
	"*The train has been destroyed. This mission has been failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel34SubTitle
	"*All of your forces are defeated. You have failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel35SubTitle
	"*All of your nano-cores have been lost. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel36SubTitle
	"*Protect your MCV!  Without it we cannot establish a base here!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel37SubTitle
	"*Your MCV was destroyed.  You have failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel38SubTitle
	"*If these monuments were to be destroyed, it would further demoralize the Soviets."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel39SubTitle
	"*The transports will arrive shortly.  Prepare to defend them as they make their way along the river."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel40SubTitle
	"*General Tatsu requires all of the transports if he is to complete his weapon."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel41SubTitle
	"*Protect the transports at all costs!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel42SubTitle
	"*We have lost one of the transports.  Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel43SubTitle
	"*Send your forces toward the beach and establish a base there."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel44SubTitle
	"*Secure this area!  We will establish a base here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel45SubTitle
	"*This area is suitable for your base of operations here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel46SubTitle
	"*If you are running low on resources, use Engineers to capture the nearby Oil Derricks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel47SubTitle
	"*The Soviet base here must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi02_imperialintel48SubTitle
	"*You and your Co-Commander will be sharing income. Proceeds from any ore you gather will be split between the two of you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*Your forces are called upon to aid with the construction of General Tatsu's secret weapon."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*You are expected to ensure the assembly area is well-defended. Here are your orders:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*Safely transport the remaining weapon parts to the assembly area."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*Ensure the weapon comes online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*General Tatsu expects you to set his plan in motion and will contact you in the field. That is all."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*The Shogun's Executioner looms over Odessa, but first you must prepare it for full combat."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*Its autonomous control systems are not yet functional so you must find sufficient power sources to fully enable it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*Defend the Shogun's Executioner at all costs and give no quarter to the Soviet forces here. That is all."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*Commander, the trains have arrived safely from Stalingrad."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*Use the Soviet's own Tesla technology to power up the Shogun's Executioner"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*Commander, the Tesla Troopers powered the Executioner's swords. More power is required."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*The Tesla coils will help power the Shogun's Executioner."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*The Tesla Coils' power has brought the Omega Shockwave online"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*The Tesla Coils were enough to get the Streak Missiles online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*We have detected a super reactor at this location. Use it to finish powering the weapon system of the Executioner."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*General Krukov must be eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*The Shogun's Executioner has been destroyed. You have failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*All of your structures have been destroyed. Mission failed"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*Ensure all of the cargo transports safely reach the assembly warehouse."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*One of the cargo transports is taking fire!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*A cargo transport has been destroyed. You have failed in your mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel22SubTitle
	"*The Shogun Executioner feeds off of the energy of the Soviet Tesla weaponry."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel23SubTitle
	"*Caution: The Shogun Executioner is taking heavy fire."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel24SubTitle
	"*Alert: The Shogun Executioner is nearly defeated. It must not fall."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel25SubTitle
	"*Soviet artillery is down. You are now able to expand your base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel26SubTitle
	"*We need to finish escorting the transports to the assembly warehouse."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel27SubTitle
	"*The Soviets know we are here. Expect enemy navy and aircraft patrols."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel28SubTitle
	"*Submerged enemies detected in the area.  Defend the transports."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel29SubTitle
	"*Find a safe location to switch your Chopper-VX units to ground form."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel30SubTitle
	"*The Shogun Executioner will be instrumental in destroying the Soviet entrenchments here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel31SubTitle
	"*Once the artillery has been destroyed, we can expand our base more easily."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel32SubTitle
	"*Soviet V4 Rocket Launchers can be deadly in large numbers. Even to the Shogun Executioner."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi03_imperialintel33SubTitle
	"*The main wall on the Soviet base has collapsed!  Now is the time to strike!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*Our position at Pearl Harbor must be defended. You have been chosen to repel the Allied fleets."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*Your orders are as follows:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*Establish a defensive perimeter in anticipation of the Allied attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*Do not allow the Allies to descrate our monuments to the Emperor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*We will provide you with reinforcements as soon as possible. Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*Our fleets of Shogun Battleships have the Allies surrounded."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*The captains of these vessels await your command. Leave no Allied vessel intact."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*An Imperial Monument is under attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*An Imperial Monument has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*An Imperial harbor is under attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*An Imperial harbor has been destroyed"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*The Allies are sending engineers after our Radar Towers."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*A Radar Tower has been captured. Our battlefield visability has been reduced."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*Capture the Radar Towers to increase battlefield visibility"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*A Radar Tower has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*Radar Towers online, our battlefield visibility has been increased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*We have detected incoming Allied Century Bombers"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*An incoming Allied MCV has been detected."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*All of the Emperor's Monuments have been destroyed. The mission is failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*The Imperial Navy's Harbors have all been destroyed. The mission is failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel22SubTitle
	"*The Allies have overrun Pearl Harbor. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel23SubTitle
	"*The Shogun Battleships have arrived."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel24SubTitle
	"*Seawings are now available to build from the Imperial Naval Yard."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel25SubTitle
	"*These Monuments and Harbors represent the heart and industry of Pearl Harbor. Three must survive the Allied attack, or all is lost."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel26SubTitle
	"*The Allies’ naval forces gather in the northeast, preparing to strike. Our Defender-VX base defenses may be used to block their way."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel27SubTitle
	"*We have detected a large Allied airforce approaching from the northwest."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel28SubTitle
	"*The Long-Range Radars here may be activated to reveal the enemy’s movements. Capture them with your Engineer."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel29SubTitle
	"*Our Shogun Battleships have been delayed en route from the northwest. However, a vanguard of Naginata Cruisers has rushed here to aid you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel30SubTitle
	"*The Naginata Cruisers are now available for construction from your Imperial Docks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel31SubTitle
	"*Position your Defender-VX base defenses in close proximity to the Monuments and Harbors for optimal coverage against the Allies' attacks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel32SubTitle
	"*Do not allow the Allies to desecrate our monuments to the Emperor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi04_imperialintel33SubTitle
	"*The Monuments to the Emperor and the Imperial Harbors must be defended against the Allies at all costs."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*The Allies have mounted a bold attack against the Black Tortoise, our floating fortress in the Pacific."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*Your orders are simple:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*Eliminate the Allied convoy en route to Japan."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*Protect the Black Tortoise at all costs."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*Allied MCVs are incoming."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*More Allied MCV's approach"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*You may now build Rocket Angel's from the Instant Dojo."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*You have been granted a squadron of Rocket Angels. They are strong against ground and air, and capable of locking down a target for others to finish."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*Use your Battleship's \"Ramming Speed\" ability to CRUSH other Naval Units!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*One enemy base neutralized"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*Two enemy bases have been neutralized"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*The final enemy base has been neutralized"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*The Power Cores are under attack. They must not be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*One Power Generator has been destroyed. Only one remains -  you must protect it at all costs!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*The Black Tortoise will be providing you power! The more damage the Power Generators take, the less power will be available!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*Commander, you have failed to keep the Engineers alive.  Deploy your Instant Dojo to train more."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*An Allied Mobile Construction Vehicle has escaped. The mission is lost."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*Both power cores have been destroyed- the Black Tortoise is no more. Misson failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*Reinforcements have arrived. Our interception forces have joined in the defense of the Floating Fortress."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*A squadron of Sky-Wings has flown in to aid your defense. In flying form, they can help stop enemy infantry. They can switch to Sea-Wing form on your command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel22SubTitle
	"*Sea-Wings should be effective against the Allied air force. Your Imperial Docks have now been upgraded to produce more Sea-Wings as needed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel23SubTitle
	"*Caution: An Allied MCV is approaching the edge of the combat zone."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi05_imperialintel24SubTitle
	"*Alert! An Allied MCV is about the escape from the combat zone. It must be destroyed at once."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*Your target is the city of Santa Monica, home to many of the Allies' media loyalists. We must capture the Allies' media centers and destroy their resistence."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*Your orders are thus:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*Make landfall on Santa Monica."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*Capture Santa Monica's media centers."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*The Black Tortoise will be the staging grounds for your attack. That is all."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*Capture the media centers in the name of the Emperor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*You have been allowed use of the WaveForce Artillery. Use it to eliminate the Allied defenses from great distance."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*These coastal areas are too crowded to establish a base. With the Island Fortress' guns, you should be able to clear space for your MCV."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*A Media Center has been captured. Commencing propaganda broadcast over this channel."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*Another Media Center has been captured."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*Only one more Media Center remains to be captured."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*All the Allied Media Centers have been captured."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*The Allies have re-captured a Media Center. It must be reclaimed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*A Media Center has been destroyed. Our mission cannot be completed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*Our advance landing party has been lost. Aborting mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*The Allies are sending reinforcements via an International Airport in this area. Capture it to stop this."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*The Americans have hidden a long-range weapon inside the observatory on the hill. Destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*This corporation creates entertainment software that encourages independent thought. Destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*This amusement area mocks the Emperor's favored attractions at Yokohama Harbor. You are expected to destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi06_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*Concentrations of law enforcement seem to be gathered around the pastry shops. Use caution when approaching."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*The Allies and the Soviets have unexpectedly joined forces in an attempt to overwhelm us. They are already upon us. Here is what we need you to do:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*Recapture our military outposts that have fallen under attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*The Allied relay stations must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*The Allies are attempting to disrupt our global communications using these stations."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*Yokohama Harbor is overun. It must be re-taken."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*Take back these forward bases and reinforcements will be dispatched to your position."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*One forward base remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*Reinforcements are inbound."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*Reinforcements have arrived, Commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*MCVs and Nanocores have arrived.  Deploy quickly, before the Allies have a chance to pick them off."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*The Allies have activated several relay stations that may disrupt all communications."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*The Soviets must be eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*All Soviet forces have been annihilated.  Good work, Commander!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*The Nanoswarm Hive Superweapon will temporarily pause the countdown on those relay stations."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*You have failed to take back the harbor. The mission is lost."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*All of your forces have been defeated. The mission is failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*All of your structures have been destroyed. The mission is lost."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*The relay station must be destroyed before…(static)"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*Commander!  (static) …the relay stations! (static)"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*Five minutes remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*One minute remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel22SubTitle
	"*Thirty seconds remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel23SubTitle
	"*Ten seconds remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel24SubTitle
	"*Five."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel25SubTitle
	"*Four."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel26SubTitle
	"*Three."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel27SubTitle
	"*Two."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel28SubTitle
	"*One."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel29SubTitle
	"*Most Allied forces should be no match for Yuriko Omega. But even she can be overwhelmed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel30SubTitle
	"*Yuriko’s psychokinetic burst special ability can repel infantry that try to surround her."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel31SubTitle
	"*Our King Oni reinforcements have arrived. Our enemies' strongest armored forces are laughable by comparison."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel32SubTitle
	"*Your Shinobi have come to defend your forces to the last man."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel33SubTitle
	"*Destroying that Allied armor facility will weaken their hold on the harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel34SubTitle
	"*We have retaken one of the Imperial forward bases."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel35SubTitle
	"*Forward base online. Only one of the forward bases remains."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel36SubTitle
	"*We have retaken all of the forward bases in the harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel37SubTitle
	"*The Allies' foothold here has been interrupted. They will not retreat, however."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel38SubTitle
	"*You will have to hold this area until additional reinforcements can be dispatched to your position."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel39SubTitle
	"*You must eliminate the Soviet heavy bombardment ships as quickly as possible."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel40SubTitle
	"*Our MCVs and Nanocores have arrived via the southern channels."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel41SubTitle
	"*The enemy's air power here has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi07_imperialintel42SubTitle
	"*Destroy the Relay Stations quickly, before time runs out!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*Moscow is prime for the taking. Forces are already assembled for a massive assault."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*The Soviets are well defended, but you will have the assistance of the Shogun's Executioner. Your objectives here are simple:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*Await the arrival of the Shogun's Executioner so that it may assist your assault."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*The Kremlin must be destroyed. Leave nothing standing."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*Such is the Emperor's decree."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*The Shogun's Executioner is on a rampage through Soviet territory.  It will rendezvous with your forces shortly.  Maintain position until it arrives."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*The Shogun's Executioner has arrived.  Support it with your forces and it shall carve a path directly to the Kremlin."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*The Soviet artillery is of great concern. It must be dealt with."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*More Soviet artillery.  We must deal with it quickly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*The Shogun's Executioner has been damaged.  Protect it until it can reach a strong enough power source to replenish itself."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*The Shogun's Executioner is under attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*Soviert General Krukov has dispatch forces to attack us."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*Soviet General Krukov has ordered naval forces down river."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*Our forces have been defeated before the Shogun's Execution arrived. The mission is lost."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*All of our forces have been defeated. The mission is failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*The Soviets will move against our position very soon."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*Hold the line, Commander.  The Shogun Executioner has nearly arrived."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*Expand your forces northward. You must press the attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*Additional Soviet forces incoming. Be on guard."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*More Soviet forces detected on scan. They act with desperation. Proceed with care."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*Prepare yourself Commander.  Soviet forces detected en route to your location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel22SubTitle
	"*The Kremlin lies in ruins. Status of the time machine, uncertain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel23SubTitle
	"*Alert: Sources indicate that the time machine is located in a sub level facility under the Kremlin."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel24SubTitle
	"*Alert: The time machine is being carried away! Destroy that helicopter!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi08_imperialintel25SubTitle
	"*Excellent work, Commander. The Emperor sends his deepest gratitude."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel01SubTitle
	"*The Allies have rallied their reminant forces in Amsterdam, led by two commanders."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel02SubTitle
	"*They defend the FutureTech Headquarters."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel03SubTitle
	"*Defeat the Allied Air base"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel04SubTitle
	"*Eliminate any Allied resistance as well."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel05SubTitle
	"*This airspace is firmly in Allied control."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel06SubTitle
	"*You will need to get by without our flight-capable forces initially. Only once the airspace is secure will our ministers be grant you fully authorized access."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel07SubTitle
	"*Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel08SubTitle
	"*The Soviet Union's top scientist has unleashed catastrophe upon Amsterdam in an attempt to eliminate our forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel09SubTitle
	"*Our Nanoswarms protected our finest warriors."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel10SubTitle
	"*Finish what we started, Commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel11SubTitle
	"*That is the Emperor's will."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel12SubTitle
	"*The FutureTech Headquarters must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel13SubTitle
	"*Eliminate the Allied Air Base, or your armies shall remain earthbound."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel14SubTitle
	"*With the Sir Case crushed, our air forces are once again yours to command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel15SubTitle
	"*General Bingham's base must be razed to the ground."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel16SubTitle
	"*There are strange readings from our scanners…"
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel17SubTitle
	"*Soviet forces approach from the north."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel18SubTitle
	"*The Soviets are using their Iron Curtain technology on the FutureTech Headquarters."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel19SubTitle
	"*Destroy his Iron Curtain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel20SubTitle
	"*These King Oni shall lead us to final victory."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel21SubTitle
	"*The Allies dominate the skies here. You must eliminate their Air Base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel22SubTitle
	"*The Futuretech Headquarters must not stand."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel23SubTitle
	"*Alert: Multiple Vacuum Imploder detonations detected. Initiating emergency Nanoswarm defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel24SubTitle
	"*The Allies' Proton Colliders threaten our plans. Destroy them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel25SubTitle
	"*Allied air presence weakening. All production facilities upgraded -- you may build flight-capable forces once more."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel26SubTitle
	"*The Soviets' top scientist is meddling with forbidden technology. Destroy his forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:mi09_imperialintel27SubTitle
	"*You cannot complete your tasks while our air support is denied. Destroy this Air Base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg01SubTitle
	"*My men are taking position outside the fortress."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg02SubTitle
	"*Mine are the men in green uniforms. They only take orders from me, but hey, you can always boss me around if you want."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg03SubTitle
	"*Mine are the men in green uniforms. They only take orders from me, but if you need my support, let me know."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg04SubTitle
	"*Attacks incoming from the south! My forces are on it!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg05SubTitle
	"*That couldn't have been the last of them... What are those sneaky goats planning...?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg06SubTitle
	"*Is that all they had? What, have we beat them already...?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg07SubTitle
	"*I don't know, those last attacks felt pretty real to me..."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg08SubTitle
	"*Does he have to keep announcing his useless strategies?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg09SubTitle
	"*Good job! Only a few more battleships left!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_cooleg10SubTitle
	"*I hope they're more of a challenge than you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*Leningrad is under siege. Repel the Imperial invaders and protect the Fortress using our remaining forces in the vicinity."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*Natasha herself is available to assist in this dark hour. Your objectives are:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*Secure the Fortress in the Heart of Leningrad. Once secure, more forces will be available."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*Defend the Fortress at all costs."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*Destroy the Imperial navy in the canals"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*Good luck to you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*The Fortress is taking heavy damage. It must not fall."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*The enemy is assaulting the Fortress. Do not let them destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*Please train five Flak Troopers. These men are our last resort."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*Flak Troopers are all we've got. Train them from your Barracks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"*Please train a Combat Engineer."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*Continue to defend the Fortress until the magnetic satellite is online"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*The Magnetic Satellite is ready to use. Use it against the Battleships."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*The Magnetic Satellite is online and ready to use."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*The Rising Sun's battleships would be vulnerable to the Magnetic Satellite."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*The Artillery Museum is under attack. Save it for the good of the Soviet people."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*The enemy assaults the Hermitage! Please protect this monument if you're able."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*The Bullfrog can eject your infantry up to the Hermitage."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel19SubTitle
	"*Use the Bullfrog to launch your troops toward the Hermitage."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel20SubTitle
	"*Select Natasha. She excels against enemy infantry."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel21SubTitle
	"*Your co-commander places green markers on targets he will defend."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel22SubTitle
	"*Your co-commander places red markers on targets he will attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel23SubTitle
	"*Select Natasha and order her attack to the gate. She is authorized to call airstrikes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel24SubTitle
	"*Natasha can call down an airstrike on the gates."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel25SubTitle
	"*Select your Barracks and train five Flak Troopers to fight for you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel26SubTitle
	"*Flak Troopers are effective against air targets and vehicles."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel27SubTitle
	"*Open the Top-Secret Protocols menu and choose the Magnetic Satellite."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel28SubTitle
	"*Top-Secret Protocols are now available."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel29SubTitle
	"*Open the Top Secret Protocols menu and request Oribtal Drop."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel30SubTitle
	"*Train more Flak Troopers to repel the enemy aggressors."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel31SubTitle
	"*Train more Concripts to defend the Fortress."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel32SubTitle
	"*Train more infantry to repel the enemy."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel33SubTitle
	"*If Natasha is injured in battle, train her again at the Barracks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel34SubTitle
	"*Enemy tanks may crush your infantry -- please beware."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel35SubTitle
	"*All is lost: all troops have perished."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel36SubTitle
	"*All is lost: Natasha has perished."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel37SubTitle
	"*All is lost: The fortress has fallen."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel38SubTitle
	"*Natasha can pilot-snipe vehicles, which may then be recovered by your infantry."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel39SubTitle
	"*Use the Magnetic Satellite to dispose of those battleships."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel40SubTitle
	"*You may select and guide the Magnetic Satellite to affect more targets."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel41SubTitle
	"*Natasha's custom rifle can strike multiple enemies in a single shot."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel42SubTitle
	"*Your Conscripts are best suited against enemy infantry."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel43SubTitle
	"*Satellite online in 7 minutes. Please be alert."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel44SubTitle
	"*Satellite online in 5 minutes. Please be wary."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel45SubTitle
	"*Satellite online in 3 minutes. Please be prepared."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel46SubTitle
	"*Satellite online in 2 minutes. Please be patient."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel47SubTitle
	"*Satellite online in 1 minute. Please be ready"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel48SubTitle
	"*Order the Combat Engineer to repair the structure."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel49SubTitle
	"*We will need the Magnetic Satellite against those battleships. I have contacted the Aerospace Bureau - the satellite will be online soon."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel50SubTitle
	"*The fortress is nearly in ruin. Please, you must find a way to stop the Imperial assault."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel51SubTitle
	"*Commander, we have transferred the last of Leningrad's treasury to you. Please spend it wisely."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel52SubTitle
	"*Your Co-Commander's forces have arrived. They are under his direct control."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel53SubTitle
	"*Your troopers are needed back at the Fortress. The Bullfrog Transport may launch them across the canal."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel54SubTitle
	"*Natasha can swim out into the canals in order to call in airstrikes against the battleships."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel55SubTitle
	"*Look for the Top Secret Protocols menu in the bottom-left corner of the screen."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel56SubTitle
	"*Open the Command Menu and select Support Powers in the six o'clock position, then choose Top-Secret Protocols."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms01_sovietintel57SubTitle
	"*Your available Top-Secret Protocols appear along the left side of the screen."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_comosk01SubTitle
	"*Launching the satellite was easy part. Now it's time to clean up this mess."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_comosk02SubTitle
	"*I must say, putting those Rising Sun scum out of their misery is good fun."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_comosk03SubTitle
	"*They were in the tents this whole time?! Go after the Imperial base! Kill them all!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_comosk04SubTitle
	"*What the…!? I've had enough of their tricks! I'll kill them all!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*The Empire must be stopped. Use our limited forces here in Krasna-45 to route the invaders. Here are your objectives:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*Escort Natasha to the orbital launch facility."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*Be on the lookout for Soviet prisoners of war."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*Proceed with caution. Good luck in the field."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*Make your way to the Launch Facility."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*The Orbital Satellite must be launched to reestablish our orbital defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*The Empire's presence here must be eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*The Empire's MCV is trying to escape. Don't let it get away."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*These must be Japan's military Engineers. They are too dangerous to be left alive."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*You have rescued a pack of trained War Bears. They are good combat scouts."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"*Some of our finest Tesla Troopers have joined you. They are effective against vehicles."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*You need anti-air weapons against these foes. There must be some Flak Troopers nearby."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*Tesla Troopers excel against armored vehicles."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*The satellite is launched, comlink re-established.  You may now use orbital bombardment against your foes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*We have reason to believe there are other Soviet troopers trapped nearby."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*Balloon bombs?! Be careful to not let them drop on your forces, sir."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*Use the \"Strike Target\" command to give priority targets to your co-commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*The Imperial MCV is escaping -- do not allow this."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel19SubTitle
	"*There are supply crates strewn about this area, which may be used to replenish damaged forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms02_sovietintel20SubTitle
	"*Caution: Our Sickle walkers are proven to be poorly suited against Imperial Tanks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_cozhan01SubTitle
	"*Sniveling Imperial cowards! Get off our land!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_cozhan02SubTitle
	"*Dreadnoughts, intact! With these warships, we can retake Vladivostok!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_cozhan03SubTitle
	"*What in the name of Lenin are those things?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_cozhan04SubTitle
	"*We need to prepare an amphibious assault against the Imperial palace."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*The time has come to drive the Empire of the Rising Sun from our soil, by retaking the port of Vladivostok."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*Here are your priorities in this mission:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*Secure a perimeter outside the port as a staging area for your attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*Eliminate the Imperial navy production facilities that have been constructed here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*May fortune favor us in this mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*The Rising Sun has contructed an administrative palace overlooking the harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*Your orders are to destroy it utterly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*Use the Bullfrog's special ability to assault the island. Eliminate the Imperials."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*Deploy your Mobile Construction Vehicle and set up a forward base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*You must build a Reactor and an Ore Refinery before you can build a Naval Yard, Commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"*We have failed to drive the Empire from Russia."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*All of your forces have been defeated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*The Stingrays are now yours to command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*Stringrays will be able to clear what your infantry might not."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*The Take Position command will order your co-commander to help cover designated areas on the battlefield."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*The Dreadnoughts have been recovered. They should be able to outreach the Imperial defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*Heavy casualties detected. We are releasing our Stingray amphibious strike craft to your command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms03_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*Please note you are sharing income with your Co-Commander. Any resources you collect will be split evenly between the two of you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_cooleg01SubTitle
	"*Such tricks this Allied witch has up her sleeve. Best be on our guard."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_cooleg02SubTitle
	"*Looks like the Allies' little witch is starting to get nervous?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_cooleg03SubTitle
	"*Let's have our Combat Engineers pay a little visit to all the bank managers around here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_cooleg04SubTitle
	"*All right, I've redeployed to a forward position."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_cooleg05SubTitle
	"*Commencing V4 bombardment! Take this you Allied dogs!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*The Allies have fortified their position along the waterfront, as well maintaining an army base inland."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*The Premier has asked that General Krukov personally supervise this operation. Your mission is:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*Investigate the energy fluctuations coming from the lake. Destroy any Allied naval forces you find."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*Eliminate the Allies' army base to clear the way for General Krukov"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*Ensure General Krukov's forces arrive safely and assist them as needed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*Convince Geneva's financial establishments to support our cause."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*Good luck to you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*General Krukov has arrived and will lead the attack against the Allied headquarters here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*Your priorities are to defend General Krukov's position and support his assault."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*Do not relent until the Allied headquarters is eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"*We've detected mysterious signals coming from the lake."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*The Allied headquarters in Geneva cannot be left standing. Destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*General Krukov is approaching from the Southeast. He'll expect the way to be cleared."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*General Krukov is supervising this battle in person. Defend his position at all costs."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*Krukov is in jeopardy. You must prevent his defeat."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*General Krukov has been defeated. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*Do not attack Comrade Krukov. The Premier would be most displeased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*Comrade Krukov has claimed some banks for his own needs. Do not oppose him."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel19SubTitle
	"*Comrade Krukov requires refineries belonging to you. Please be generous."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel20SubTitle
	"*You have gained access to V4 Rocket Launchers. Use their superior range wisely."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel21SubTitle
	"*Commander, you are able to build near your Co-Commander's structures as well as your own."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel22SubTitle
	"*Allied naval threat level greater than expected. You have been authorized to use Akula Subs in this region."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel23SubTitle
	"*You now have access to the Soviet Battle Lab structure."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel24SubTitle
	"*Your forces lie in ruin. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel25SubTitle
	"*Your co-commander has been defeated. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel26SubTitle
	"*The Allied Port is key to their Northern European operations. Destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel27SubTitle
	"*The Allies infest Geneva. Destroy their headquarters and drive them out."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel28SubTitle
	"*General Krukov is surveying this battle firsthand. His bunker must remain safe at all times."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel29SubTitle
	"*General Krukov's bunker is under attack. Defend him at once."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel30SubTitle
	"*Alert: General Krukov is at great risk - his safety is your highest priority."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel31SubTitle
	"*Our V4 Rocket Launchers are now available. Use them to rain destruction upon our enemies."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel32SubTitle
	"*Send Combat Engineers into the Swiss Banks to bolster your income for this mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel33SubTitle
	"*General Krukov's bunker has been destroyed. The Premier will not approve.  Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms04_sovietintel34SubTitle
	"*You have been defeated. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_cozhan01SubTitle
	"*My Bullfrogs are on their way. I'll have island clear for you within minutes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_cozhan02SubTitle
	"*Don't worry, my forces will take care of it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_cozhan03SubTitle
	"*Those Spectrum Towers are making this difficult. Send your Twinblade choppers after them!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_cozhan04SubTitle
	"*That Tech Inhibitor is preventing us from using the best of our forces. How about we take it down?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_cozhan05SubTitle
	"*Defeat one of those Allied roach and another springs forth. Our work here isn't done."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*The Allies' Science Facility is in the area, and we must capture it before the Allies can respond."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*Your objectives are as follows:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*Take over the Allies' ore-mining operations near the deployment zone."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*Eliminate the Allies' naval forces in the area."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*Locate and capture the Allies' science facility."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*Good hunting."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*Our engineers say they are going to need time to decipher and extract the Allies' military weapon data."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*You need to defend the science facility against Allied attempts to recapture or attack. They will stop at nothing to reclaim the facility."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*Commander, remember to occupy the islands to the east. Their Ore Mines will fund your efforts."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*The Allied Tech Inhibitor is denying the use of our full military arsenal. Take it out."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"*Commander, you are authorized to use our Twinblade combat gunships. They are powerful and versatile."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*The Tech Inhibitor is destroyed. You have regained access to additional technology."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*Commander, we are downloading data on new Allied weapons technology. You must defend the science facility until we have that data."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*The Allies have recaptured the facility! Quickly, you must capture it again!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*You have recaptured the facility. Do not let it fall into Allied hands."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*Commander, your forces lie in ruin. Mission Aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*Your Co-Commander's base has been utterly destroyed. Mission Aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*Commander, the data has been encrypted and is of no use. Mission Aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms05_sovietintel19SubTitle
	"*The Allies are preparing to retaliate with air power. You are now authorized to build our own MiG Fighters to repel them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_cooleg01SubTitle
	"*All right, I'll take the base to the east."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_cooleg02SubTitle
	"*Western Allied base? No problem. Consider it dead."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_cooleg03SubTitle
	"*Why would they build in somewhere so inaccessible."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_cooleg04SubTitle
	"*Best not wait around for that thing to fire. We'd better take it down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_cooleg05SubTitle
	"*Burn, you old fool! You had this coming!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_cooleg06SubTitle
	"*Oh, it's that guy? I've been waiting to wipe that smirk off his face for years. Let's do this."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*The last major Allied target in Europe is the Von Esling Airbase. Destroying this base will effectively free the last of European lands from Allied control."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*Your objective is simple:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*Locate the Von Esling Airbase and destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*Due to the significance of this operation, General Krukov will once again be on site to supervise."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*Best of luck, Commander - This is a treacherous place."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*The Premier has retaken command. He has prioritized a new objective of high authority."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*Your forces are to eliminate General Krukov."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*The Allied Air Base must still be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*The Premier expects your compliance."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*Von Esling airbase is alerted to our presence. Please proceed with caution."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"*General Krukov has arrived to supervise this battle personally."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*The Premier has spoken. Your new target is Krukov."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*The Allies have a Proton Collider in the vicinity. You must find a way to destroy it before it can fire."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*To support you in your goal, the Premier has provided you a new Soviet superweapons - the Vacuum Imploder."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*Krukov's army has sworn allegiance to you, Commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*Krukov's forces have sworn allegiance to your CoCommander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*The Allies' Von Esling airbase has been detected. It must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*Capture the Oil Derricks in order to secure additional income for this mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel19SubTitle
	"*The Premier has authorized you to construct Kirov Airships."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel20SubTitle
	"*Krukov has been branded a traitor. Your priority is to eliminate him."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel21SubTitle
	"*An expansion base will cement our grip on this battlefield."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel22SubTitle
	"*It appears there is no land or sea access to this branch of the Allies' base. You must find another way to attack it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel23SubTitle
	"*Your Co-Commander has been defeated. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms06_sovietintel24SubTitle
	"*Your base of operations is in ruin. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_comosk01SubTitle
	"*So this is our army for taking out the Emperor?! That's it?!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_comosk02SubTitle
	"*They're coming out of the woodwork it seems. Good..."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_comosk03SubTitle
	"*Is that the emperor? If only I could kill him with my own hands."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_comosk04SubTitle
	"*Our revenge is sweet, wouldn't you say, commander?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*The Premier has ordered the assassination of the Emperor of the Rising Sun. Here is what you must do:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*Assault the Emperor Yoshiro's palace grounds."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*Eliminate Emperor Yoshiro. Make certain the Emperor does not escape."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*Your forces have already begun their air drops into the Imperial Palace. Good luck to you in this operation."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*The Empire of the Rising Sun's frontline commanders have assembled to protect their Emperor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*The Premier has called for you to eliminate them along with the Emperor himself."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*Invasion Force inbound."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*Castle grounds crawl with Imperial guards. Sneak past patrols to the garden to search for the Emperor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*Contact has been lost with landing party. The mission is a failure."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*Distraction needed to draw troops away from garden."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"*Keep moving toward the Emperor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*MCV's inbound. Use to construct new base and take battle to hated enemies."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*Japanese commanders are protected by substantial defenses. Friends at the Kremlin have sent plans for Kirov. Use to rain down death on enemies of glorious revolution."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*You now have access to Apocalpse Tanks- the toughest armor in the world."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*The Premier has authorized use of Vacuum Bomb. Construct Vacuum Imploder building to use."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*All our forces have been destroyed. Mission failure."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*With foolish Japanese commanders dead, you are free to focus attack on Emperor's Palace. Bring down this enclave of the entrenched bourgeoisie"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*The Emperor is inside of that armor- eliminate him."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel19SubTitle
	"*Despite the loss of our initial forces, the distraction allowed our MCVs to land nearby. Use our Apocalypse Tanks and construct a base to exact revenge on this place."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms07_sovietintel20SubTitle
	"*The path to the Emperor is clear. Finish him at once."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_alliedsoldier01SubTitle
	"Good afternoon, friend. Are you here to escort us to our meeting with the Premier?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_alliedsoldier02SubTitle
	"It's a setup! Retreat, retreat!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_alliedsoldier03SubTitle
	"What the--they've double-crossed us! Open fire!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_alliedsoldier04SubTitle
	"You cheating commie scum. Wait'll Allied high command gets wind of this."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_cozhan01SubTitle
	"*I just love these kinds of missions. But I wonder…  Are we supposed to be the cheese or the trap?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_cozhan02SubTitle
	"*They have the island, but they have left themselves no place to run."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_cozhan03SubTitle
	"*Well played! They didn't stand a chance."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_cozhan04SubTitle
	"*We did it! The Soviet people will be safer now, without that maniac."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_cozhan05SubTitle
	"*Do you require assistance, Commander?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_cozhan06SubTitle
	"*Tesla Tanks, weaponized Moai heads... A volcano fortress... Such madness."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_cozhan07SubTitle
	"*Brother against brother... May we end this madness quickly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*The Allies are en route from the southeast, expecting to negotiate a treaty."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*However, your task is to destroy them, therefore you must draw first blood. Here is what you must do:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*Prepare an assault against the Allied forces coming to meet with the Premier."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*Do not strike until you have the signal."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*Standby for further orders from the Premier."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*Good fortune to you in battle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*Commander, your mission has changed. The Premier is your new target, and you are his new target."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*You must eliminate the Premier."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*His fortress may be vulnerable to a direct attack, though forces loyal to the Premier will stand in your way."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*Be especially mindful of the Premier's experimental Tesla Tanks. Even now, our satellites show that he is mobilizing them against your position."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"* The Allied Emissary's naval fleet is arriving soon. Build up sizeable force."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*Wait for emissary to reach docks before surrounding him.  We don't want the fool to escape."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*The Premier is attempting to target your base with a super weapon."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*The Premier's super weapon is now firing. We cannot win now. Mission fail."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*It is done…let us focus on Premier's secret volcano fortress."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*Five minutes remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*One minute remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*Thirty seconds remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel19SubTitle
	"*Ten seconds remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel20SubTitle
	"*Five."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel21SubTitle
	"*Four."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel22SubTitle
	"*Three."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel23SubTitle
	"*Two."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel24SubTitle
	"*One."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel25SubTitle
	"*The Allies have escaped- your mission is failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel26SubTitle
	"*The Allied Emissary got away. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel27SubTitle
	"*The emissary will be arriving by sea. Be prepared to strike from the air or the waters."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel28SubTitle
	"*Enemy force composition not yet known. Observe the Allied forces carefully as they arrive."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel29SubTitle
	"*The emissary has arrived. We are making final confirmations that he is on board before giving the order to attack. Standby."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel30SubTitle
	"*Cleared to engage. Attack the Allies now. Destroy the emissary and all of his forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel31SubTitle
	"*Be advised: The allies have established a base to the west on a small island."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel32SubTitle
	"*Commander, we have located several ore mines to the north of your position."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel33SubTitle
	"*The Premier intends to eliminate us all with his new superweapon. Please hurry, commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel34SubTitle
	"*Beware of the enemy Tesla Tanks. These experimental forces appear to have very few vulnerabilities."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel35SubTitle
	"*The Premier's stronghold appears to have been built into the volcano itself."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel36SubTitle
	"*The fortress is well defended. However, destroying three key support structures should disable it completely."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel37SubTitle
	"*One fortress structure down. Two remain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietintel38SubTitle
	"*Two fortress structures eliminated. One remains."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms08_sovietsoldier01SubTitle
	"I am afraid not, \"my friend.\" Comrades! Attack now!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_comosk01SubTitle
	"*Let's take these terror drones out for a little walk!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_comosk02SubTitle
	"*Yes! Let's take her down!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_comosk03SubTitle
	"*Where did you get these Tesla Tanks from anyway...?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_comosk04SubTitle
	"*That she-wolf put up a fight, I'll give her that."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_comosk05SubTitle
	"*Ah, they still want to fight! All the more to kill!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel01SubTitle
	"*This could be the final battle plan, Commander. Our targets are the Allied military fortress in New York City, as well as the Statue Liberty."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel02SubTitle
	"*The Allies will be on high alert, relying on any forces they can muster- take caution when moving in on a base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel03SubTitle
	"*You must topple the symbol of their tyranny: The Statue of Liberty."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel04SubTitle
	"*With this symbolic gesture, the Allies will have no choice but to submit to the Soviet revolution. Good luck, Comrade."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel05SubTitle
	"*The city is heavily fortified. This will require a superior strategy."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel06SubTitle
	"*We've infiltrated small force via Ellis Island.  Use them to recover captured MCV's"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel07SubTitle
	"*Commander, it seems Fort Bradley has upgraded alert status."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel08SubTitle
	"*Commander, the Liberty Park garrison has upgraded their Alert Status."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel09SubTitle
	"*Commander, our forces are picking up Chronosphere energy signatures near the Statue of Liberty!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel10SubTitle
	"*You'll each need engineer to get MCV up and running Commander. Do NOT waste them all!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel11SubTitle
	"*Capturing Allied Technology is all good and well, Commander, but do NOT forget you will need Engineer to get MCVs working as intended."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel12SubTitle
	"*Engineer is essential."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel13SubTitle
	"*Fort Bradley’s ore-refining operations offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel14SubTitle
	"*Your invasion force is imminent. Please standby."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel15SubTitle
	"*Your invasion force has arrived."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel16SubTitle
	"*An allied attack is incoming."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel17SubTitle
	"*Alert: Chronosphere anomalies detected."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel18SubTitle
	"*Alert: Allied paradrop incoming."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel19SubTitle
	"*Set up an outpost near Fort Bradley's vacated ore mines if you require additional resources."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel20SubTitle
	"*Our Twinblades can transport infantry and vehicle reinforcements across the river."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ms09_sovietintel21SubTitle
	"*Plans for the Premier's ultimate weapon, the Vacuum Imploder, are now available to you."
End

